  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "num": "01",
      "en": "Dear Xiao Li, My time here in China is going well. I love my new school and classmates. Over the October holiday, my parents and I are planning to go to Xi'an to see the Terracotta Army. I've heard that it is an {amazing} {sight}, and I can't wait to go. To me, the story of the Terracotta Army is almost unbelievable. It's {amazing} that there are more than 8,000 statues, and no one in modern times knew about them until the 1970s. We're also planning to visit several other places in Xi'an. My dad and I are both looking forward to going to the Shaanxi History Museum, because my dad loves history and I have heard that this museum is known as a \"Chinese treasure house\"! We're also going to the Xi'an City Wall and a few other famous sights. We're taking the train, leaving the day before the October holiday begins. We're arriving at 9:30 a.m. and will start sightseeing right away, so I hope we sleep well on the train! I guess that's all for now! I'll write again soon and send photos! Do you have any plans for the coming holiday? Hope to hear from you soon.",
      "cn": "亲爱的小李：我在中国一切都好。我喜欢我的新学校和同学们。十一假期期间，我和父母打算去西安看兵马俑。听说那是一处令人惊叹的景观，我已经迫不及待了。对我来说，兵马俑的故事简直令人难以置信。那里有 8000 多尊陶俑，直到 20 世纪 70 年代现代人才知晓它们的存在，这真令人称奇。 我们还计划游览西安的其他几处景点。爸爸和我都盼着去陕西历史博物馆，因为我爸爸热爱历史，而我也听说这家博物馆被誉为\"中国宝库\"！我们还打算去西安古城墙和其他几处著名景点。 我们打算坐火车，在十一假期开始前的前一天出发。我们上午 9:30 到达，会立刻开始观光，所以希望我们能在火车上睡个好觉！ 我想今天就写到这里吧！我很快会再给你写信并附上照片！即将到来的假期你有什么安排吗？期待尽快收到你的回信。"
    }
  ],
